{"ID":"20240205153711-wx8q6ev","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153711-wx8q6ev","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153711-wx8q6ev\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162701-twat6b7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162701-twat6b7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162701-twat6b7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"五灵脂","type":"doc","updated":"20240830115047"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205162701-twat6b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162701-twat6b7","updated":"20240205162701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"五灵脂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/五灵脂-20240205162701-t9ylo5h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709125500-cpq5kck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709125500-cpq5kck","updated":"20240709125500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 318px;","style":"width: 308px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠2-20240703102641-gd0l43t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 308px;\" parent-style=\"width: 318px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 307px;","style":"width: 297px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠7-20240703103125-l2kaszs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 297px;\" parent-style=\"width: 307px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709125500-dqeghqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709125500-dqeghqu","updated":"20240709125500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 371px;","style":"width: 361px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠-20240703102611-83gpr5m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 361px;\" parent-style=\"width: 371px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 606px;","style":"width: 596px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠3-20240703102717-cihtt4e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 596px;\" parent-style=\"width: 606px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709125500-hur1zzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709125500-hur1zzy","updated":"20240709125500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 674px;","style":"width: 664px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠4-20240703102745-obaacmk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 664px;\" parent-style=\"width: 674px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 566px;","style":"width: 556px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠10"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠10-20240703103313-ia8wbk6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 556px;\" parent-style=\"width: 566px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709125500-2xccimq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709125500-2xccimq","updated":"20240709125500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 498px;","style":"width: 488px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠6-20240703102952-op47x00.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 488px;\" parent-style=\"width: 498px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 742px;","style":"width: 732px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠5-20240703102843-7dumnft.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 732px;\" parent-style=\"width: 742px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709125500-a06n9by","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709125500-a06n9by","updated":"20240709125500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 582px;","style":"width: 572px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠8-20240703103150-xjnr8g5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 572px;\" parent-style=\"width: 582px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 647px;","style":"width: 637px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"棕鼯鼠9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/棕鼯鼠9-20240703103214-sm7o431.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 637px;\" parent-style=\"width: 647px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709125405-eimartc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709125405-eimartc","updated":"20240709125420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为鼯鼠大便。"}]},{"ID":"20240709125405-k4wltom","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240709125405-k4wltom"}},{"ID":"20240830115039-a9odypz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-a9odypz","updated":"20240830115047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：五灵脂"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-rksb5fo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-rksb5fo","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五灵脂《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-57yuhly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-57yuhly","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǔLínɡZhī"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-g6qflpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-g6qflpc","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】灵脂、糖灵脂、灵脂米、灵脂块"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-h7ms2vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-h7ms2vj","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为鼯鼠科动物橙足鼯鼠TrogopterusXanthipesMilne-Edwards或飞鼠科动物小飞鼠PteromysvolansL.的干燥粪便。全年可收采。将砂石、泥土等杂质除净。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-4pt0i8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-4pt0i8j","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-lkfnifx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-lkfnifx","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材分为灵脂米（散灵脂）及灵脂块（糖灵脂）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-wu3hyyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-wu3hyyx","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"灵脂米（散灵脂）：长椭圆形颗粒，两端钝圆，长0.5～1.2厘米，直径0.3～0.6厘米。表面粗糙，棕褐色或黑褐色，显麻点，体轻，质松，易折断。断面呈纤维性，黄色、黄绿色或黑棕色。气微弱，味苦咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-th20drj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-th20drj","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"灵脂块：为鼯鼠尿和粪粒凝结而成的不规则团块，黑棕色、黄棕色或灰棕色，凹凸不平，有的有油润性光泽，粪粒呈长椭圆形，表面常裂碎，显纤维性，体轻，质较硬，但易碎。断面不平坦，可模糊看出粪粒的形状，有的间有黄棕色松香样物质。有腥臭气，味苦。以块状、黑褐色、有光泽、显油润、无杂质者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-7vnhplo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-7vnhplo","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】醋灵脂：将净五灵脂放锅内微炒，喷洒米醋，再炒至微干，表面稍有光泽时取出，晾干即可。如系灵脂块须砍成小块（每10斤用醋1.5斤）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-9z87jqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-9z87jqv","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-dpzl4cw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-dpzl4cw","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】活血散瘀，炒炭止血。用于心腹淤血作痛，痛经，血瘀经闭，产后淤血腹痛；炒炭治崩漏下血；外用治跌打损伤，蛇、虫咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-u8svjwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-u8svjwo","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】1～3钱；外用适量，研粉酒调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-28s2pfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-28s2pfz","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】不宜与人参同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-l3itdrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-l3itdrt","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-3bmcbw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-3bmcbw5","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五灵脂《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-nhae2ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-nhae2ml","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《开宝本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-g4ynp15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-g4ynp15","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǔLínɡZhī"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-ljre9cq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-ljre9cq","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】药本（侯宁极《药谱》），寒号虫粪（《开宝本草》），寒雀粪（《中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-sje02vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-sje02vu","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为鼯鼠科动物橙足鼯鼠和飞鼠等的干燥粪便。全年可采，但以春、秋为多，春采者品质较仕。采得后，拣净砂石、泥土等杂质，按形状分别为\"灵脂块\"和\"灵脂米\"两类。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-bqz49kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-bqz49kj","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-93kl3py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-93kl3py","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①橙足鼯鼠，又名：寒号虫（《开宝本草》），寒号鸟、寒搭拉虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-kurzuru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-kurzuru","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全长约54厘米，尾长而粗，几与体长相等。吻短，眼圆而大，耳廓发达，无束毛。后肢长于前肢，均有钩爪；肢间有飞膜。头部耳前侧有橘黄色斑点；背毛基部淡灰黑色，上部淡黄色，尖端黑色；颈背部黄色较背部明显。腹毛灰白色，具淡橙色毛尖。飞膜色与腹面同，惟边缘为灰白色，可清楚的看出背腹的分界。尾背面色与体背面近似，但较浅，尾端黑色，连成一纵纹，直至尾端。前后足背面为橙黄色，但后足杂有灰黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-3oebhxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-3oebhxo","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栖于长有柏树的山地。筑窝于岩石陡壁上的石涸或岩缝中；在洞穴附近常见到灰黑色的粪便。喜在晨昏或晚间活动，能滑翔和爬树。食物主要为柏树的树籽及嫩叶。分布河北、山西、青海、甘肃、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-sj8tpyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-sj8tpyi","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②飞鼠"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-rc1g9ep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-rc1g9ep","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形似松鼠而小，体长135～160毫米。尾长约为体长的2／3。眼大，周围有黑毛构成窄环。前后肢间具被毛的飞膜。尾扁平，被密而柔软的长毛。全体深灰黑色，背毛夏季为棕灰色，带有灰黑色的波纹；冬季淡黄灰或黄灰色。腹毛白色.尾两侧橙黄色。飞膜上下面毛色与体背，腹面相同，惟与腹面两侧相交处带橙黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-czh08rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-czh08rw","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栖深山密林，筑窝于树洞中。夜晚活动觅食，常在树间滑翔。食物主要为松籽、橡实、嫩树枝、浆果等。分布东北、内蒙古、河北、山西、新疆等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-or7evu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-or7evu8","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-7xnvnkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-7xnvnkz","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①灵脂块"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-chcqxz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-chcqxz7","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：糖灵脂。系由许多粪粒凝结而成，呈不规则的块状，大小不一。表面黑棕色，黄棕色、红棕色或灰棕色，凹凸不平，有的有油润性光泽；粪粒呈长椭圆柱形，其表面常碎裂，呈纤维性。体轻，质较硬，但较易破碎，断面不平坦，可模糊地看出粪粒的形状，有时呈纤维性。气腥臭，味苦。以块状、黑棕色、有光泽、油润而无杂质者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-6pyu5go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-6pyu5go","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②灵脂米"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-s18iw3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-s18iw3f","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：散灵脂。呈长椭圆形圆柱状，两端钝圆，长5～15毫米，直径3～6毫米。表面黑棕色，较平滑残微祖糙，常可见浅色的斑点，有的具有光泽。体轻而松，易折断，断面黄色，黄绿色或黑棕色，呈纤维性。气微弱，味微苦咸。以表面粗糙，外黑棕色、内黄绿色，体轻无杂质者佳。品质较灵脂块为差。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-3zt3p4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-3zt3p4k","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上2种药材主产河北、山西。此外，甘肃、吉林、新疆、北京郊区亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-165rjij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-165rjij","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】五灵脂：拣净杂质，打碎（灵脂块）或筛去灰屑（灵脂米）用。醋灵脂：取净五灵脂，置锅内，文火微炒，随即喷淋米醋，再炒至微干、有光泽为度，取出晾干。酒灵脂：制法同上，惟用黄酒喷淋。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-r2vn5w2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-r2vn5w2","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-hdr00m8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-hdr00m8","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-e36otws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-e36otws","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《开宝本草》：\"味甘，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-70hu8gn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-70hu8gn","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草汇言》：\"味甘酸，气平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-gb0l2te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-gb0l2te","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》：\"苦酸，寒，小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-8snzjmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-8snzjmd","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-3x2bzy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-3x2bzy6","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肝、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-k8mfdom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-k8mfdom","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入心、肝二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-lscqe5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-lscqe5s","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经解》：\"入足厥阴肝经、足太阴脾经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-7meww8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-7meww8r","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-dsj8c46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-dsj8c46","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生用行血止痛。治心腹血气诸痛，妇女经闭，产后瘀血作痛；外治蛇、蝎、蜈蚣咬伤。炒用止血。治妇女血崩，经水过多，赤带不绝。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-xn1oxkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-xn1oxkp","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《开宝本草》：\"主疗心腹冷气，小儿五疳，辟疫，治肠风，通利气脉，女子月闭。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-9dzik5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-9dzik5y","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草图经》：\"治伤冷积聚及小儿女子方中多用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-eg4mykc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-eg4mykc","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草衍义补遗》：\"能行血止血。治心腹冷气，妇人心痛，血气刺痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-rl86ymw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-rl86ymw","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草蒙筌》：\"行血宜生，止血须炒，通经闭及治经行不止；定产妇血晕，除小儿疳蛔。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-gxwxjb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-gxwxjb5","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"止妇人经水过多，赤带不绝，胎前产后，血气诸痛；男女一切心腹、胁肋。少腹诸痛，疝痛，血痢、肠风腹痛；身体血痹刺痛，肝疟发寒热，反胃，消渴及痰涎挟血成窠，血贯疃子，血凝齿痛，重舌，小儿惊风，五痫，癫疾；杀虫，解药毒及蛇蝎蜈蚣伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-qo1224y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-qo1224y","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草述》：\"主损伤接骨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-dwb94z7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-dwb94z7","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《现代实用中药》：\"涂敷疮疥。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-pcfctlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-pcfctlb","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；或入丸、散。外用：研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-d9u2xw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-d9u2xw4","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-w8vvbvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-w8vvbvr","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"恶人参，损人。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-p8elb1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-p8elb1b","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"血虚腹痛，血虚经闭，产妇去血过多发晕，心虚有火作痛，病属血虚无瘀滞者，皆所当忌。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-t61oj2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-t61oj2g","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-6xmyln3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-6xmyln3","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治产后恶露不快，腰痛，少腹如刺，时作寒热，头痛不思饮食；又治久有瘀血，月水不调，黄瘦不食；亦疗心痛：五灵脂水淘净，炒末一两，以好米醋调稀，慢火熬膏，入真蒲黄和丸龙眼大。每服一丸，以水与童子小便各半盏，煎至七分，温服，少顷再服；经闭者，酒磨服下。（《产乳集验方》紫金丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-1l2ep3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-1l2ep3r","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治妇人经血不止：五灵脂末，炒令过熟，出尽烟气。每服大两钱，用当归两片，酒一中盏，与药末同煎至六分，去滓热服，连三、五服。（《经效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-0snqf30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-0snqf30","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治产后心腹痛欲死：蒲黄（炒香）、五灵脂（酒研，淘去砂土）等分。为末，先用酽醋调二钱，熬成膏，入水一盏，煎七分，食前热服。（《局方》失笑散）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-yix060i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-yix060i","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治丈夫脾积气痛，妇人血崩诸痛：飞过五灵脂（炒烟尽），研末。每服一钱，温酒调下。（《永类钤方》灵脂散）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-hqoaqx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-hqoaqx8","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治卒暴心痛，不可忍者：五灵脂，为细末。每服二钱，热洒下，妇人醋汤下。（《鸡峰昔济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-3l72ymp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-3l72ymp","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治风冷气血闭，手足身体疼痛，冷麻：五灵脂二两，没药一两，乳香半两，川乌头一两半（炮去皮）。同为末，滴水丸如弹子大。每用一丸，生姜温酒磨服。（《本草衍义》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-svqad3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-svqad3l","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治肠风下血：飞过五灵脂，炒烟尽，研末。每服一钱，煎乌梅、柏叶汤下。（《永类钤方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-hazyl83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-hazyl83","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治血妄行入胃，吐不止：五灵脂一两，黄耆半两。为末，新汲水服二钱。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-tb91xx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-tb91xx5","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治虫心痛欲绝：五灵脂（末）二钱匕，白矾（火飞）半钱匕。同研，每服一、二钱，水一盏，煎五分，温服，无时。（《阎氏小儿方论》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-hn6iue2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-hn6iue2","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治骨折肿痛：五灵脂、白芨各一两，乳香、没药各三钱。为末，热水同香油调涂患处。（《乾坤生意秘韫》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-jik3dt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-jik3dt1","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治损伤，接骨：五灵脂一两，茴香一钱。上二味为细末；另研乳香为细末，于极痛处掺上，用小黄米粥涂了，后用二味药末掺于上，再用帛子裹了，用木片子缠了。（《儒门事亲》接骨丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-fv8q61z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-fv8q61z","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治火风疮癞：油调五灵脂末涂之。（《摘元方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-tzcsao0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-tzcsao0","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治蜈蚣蛇蝎毒虫伤：以五灵脂末涂之。（《金匮钩玄》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-hn5erhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-hn5erhy","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治肺胀：五灵脂（研）二两，柏子仁半两，胡桃八枚（去壳研）。上三味研成膏，滴水为丸，如小豆大，煎木香甘草汤下十五丸。（《圣济总录》皱肺丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-lc4l88u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-lc4l88u","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治目生浮翳：五灵脂、海螺蛸各等分。为细末，熟猪肝日蘸食。（《明目经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-04230qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-04230qz","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治重舌、喉痹：五灵脂一两，为细末，用米醋一大碗煎，旋噙漱口。（《经验良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-f5zh25n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-f5zh25n","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-y5cwirm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-y5cwirm","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治疗儿枕痛（产后子宫复旧不全）"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-4x21wtu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-4x21wtu","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取五灵脂置锅内加热，随炒随加米醋拌匀，待嗅到药味后，取出研细末。每服2钱，黄酒送下，每日3次。通常服1天痛减，2天痊愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-l06scc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-l06scc7","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗毒蛇咬伤"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-i8rhnp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-i8rhnp0","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取五灵脂2份，雄黄1份，共研细末，每次用黄酒冲服2钱（不善饮酒者可用茶调服），同时外敷创口，每日3次。再配合内服食醋、扩创、吸毒等法。如有高热、咽干痛、谵妄、狂躁等症，是蛇毒内陷所致，除加重药物用量外，再根据临床症状辨证施治。治疗10例，皆愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-rmwf5lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-rmwf5lk","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-w8tp641","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-w8tp641","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五灵脂《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-2ryx6cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-2ryx6cf","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《开宝本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-5l50668","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-5l50668","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WǔLínɡZhī"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-cvx6abb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-cvx6abb","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】TrogopterusDung,dungofComplex-toothedFlyingSquirrel"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-ywk7ukh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-ywk7ukh","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】药本、寒号虫粪、寒雀粪"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-lm9rz70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-lm9rz70","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-nuhyepl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-nuhyepl","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为鼯鼠科动物复齿鼯鼠之干燥粪便。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-sgnzu1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-sgnzu1r","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：TrogopterusxanthipesMilne-Edwards"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-64d2437","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-64d2437","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年可采，但在春、秋季为多，春季采者品质较佳，采得后，拣净砂石、泥土等杂质，晒干。按春形状的不同常分为“灵脂块”及“灵脂米”。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-zfsixn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-zfsixn2","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】复齿鼯鼠，形如松鼠，但较松鼠略大，为中等的一种鼯鼠。体长20-30cm，体生250-400g。头宽、吻较短。眼圆而大，耳壳显着，耳基部前后方生有黑色细长的簇毛。前后肢间有皮膜相连。尾呈扁平状，略短于体长，尾毛长而蓬松。全身背毛为灰黄褐色，毛基部黑灰色，上部黄色，尖端黑褐色。颜脸部较淡，为灰色，耳同身色。腹部毛色较浅。毛基灰白色，毛尖黄棕色。皮膜上下一与背腹面色相同，唯侧缘呈鲜橙黄色。四足色较深，为棕黄色。尾为灰黄色，尾尖有黑褐色长毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-e9pt7av","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-e9pt7av","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-a22pnml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-a22pnml","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：本种炮国特有。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-hu7yiv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-hu7yiv7","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：已知分布于河北、山西、陕西、四川、云南、西藏等。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-cg316oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-cg316oe","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-21j1exr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-21j1exr","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生活习性，生活于长有松柏树的高山岩石陡壁的石洞或石缝中窝形如鸟巢，内铺以树枝、杂草等。白天于窝中睡觉，清晨或夜间外出活动，善攀爬，能滑翔。以松柏树叶为食，尤喜食柏树籽。每年繁殖1-2次，每次2-4仔幼仔初生时无毛，但皮膜及为明显。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-ygipflj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-ygipflj","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"养殖技术，鼯鼠的人工饲养有箱养、笼养和洞养3种方法。饲喂柏树叶、嫩皮、嫩枝和一些昆虫类等。冬季注意保肯，夏季防热，并及时供给干净冷水。尽量为它创造活动条件，以增加排粪量。防止猫、鼠鼬及各种食肉猛禽等天敌的伤害。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-1x55s01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-1x55s01","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-j51af2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-j51af2s","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别（1）灵脂块，又名糖灵脂。呈不规则的块状，大小不一。表面黑棕色、红棕色或灰棕色，凹凸不平，有油9润性光泽，粘附的颗粒呈长椭圆形，表面常裂碎，显纤维性。质硬，断面黄棕色或棕褐色，不平坦，有的可见了颗粒，间或有黄棕色树脂状物质。气腥臭。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-0jruq76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-0jruq76","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）灵脂米，又名散灵脂，为长椭圆形颗粒，长5-15mm，直径3-6mm。表面黑棕色、红棕色或灰棕色，较平滑或微粗糙，常可见淡黄色的纤维残痕，有的略具光泽。体轻，质松，易折断，断面黄绿色中黄褐色，不平坦，纤维性。气微。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-6jx9h4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-6jx9h4z","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】复齿鼯鼠的干燥粪便，含焦性儿茶酚（pyrocatechol），苯甲酸（benzoicacid），3-蒈烯-9，10-二羧酸（3-caren-9，10-dicarboxylicacid），尿嘧淀（urcil），五灵脂酸（wulingzhicacid）间羟基苯甲酸（m-hydroxybenzoicacid），原儿茶酸（protocatechuicacid），次黄嘌呤（hypoxanthing），尿囊素（allantoin），L-酷氨酸（L-tyrosine），3-O-顺-对-香豆酰委陵菜酸（3-O-cis-p-coumaroyltormenticacid），3-O-反对-香豆酰委陵菜酸（3-O-trans-p-coumaroyltormenticacid），坡模醇酸（pomolicacid），2α-羟基熊黑酸（2α-hydroxyursolicacid），高加蓝花楹三萜酸（jacoumaricacid），3-O-反-对-香豆酰马期里酸（3-O-trans-p-coumaroylmaslinicacid），熊果酸（ursolicacid），委陵菜酸（tormenticacid），野雅椿酸（euscaphicacid），马斯里酸（masolinicacid）；还含三对节萜酸（serratagenicacid），五灵脂三萜酸（goreishicacid）Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ，5-甲氧基-7-羟基香豆素（5-methoxy-7-hydroxycoumarin）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-xjnml8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-xjnml8w","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-zy3wg9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-zy3wg9h","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.对心血管系统的影响：五灵脂20mg/kg股动脉注入使麻醉狗股动脉血流量增加，血管阻力降低。五灵脂水提液200ug/ml可显着降低大鼠乳鼠体外培养心肌细胞的耗氧量。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-b4bkyg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-b4bkyg7","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗凝作用：五灵脂水提液2.0g/ml有增强体外纤维蛋白溶解作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-5yrw8xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-5yrw8xs","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对子宫的作用：五灵脂水煎剂2.0×10（－2）g/ml或4.0×10（－2）g/ml对离体家兔子宫呈短时间张力提高，几分钟后恢复正常，部分出现后抑制现象，而对频率、幅度影响小。体外试验证明，五灵脂对结核杆菌及多种皮肤真菌有不同程度的抑制作用；还有缓解平滑肌痉挛的作用，临床上也曾用于心绞痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-yusrwfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-yusrwfy","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.抗结核作用：五灵脂对小白鼠实验性结核病有一定的治疗效果，所用复方为连翘、五灵脂各2g；或连翘、五灵脂、地骨皮、紫草根各2g。上方对豚鼠实验性结核病也均有一定疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-hpo989v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-hpo989v","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-frmkrxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-frmkrxr","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.净制：拣净杂质，筛去灰屑（灵脂米）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-oospeai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-oospeai","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.碎制：灵脂块需打碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-k680v09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-k680v09","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.醋制：取净五灵脂，置锅内，文火微炒，随即喷淋米醋，再炒至微干、有光泽为度，取出晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-ka58yz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-ka58yz0","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.酒制：制法同上，惟用黄酒喷淋。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-fc6ccat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-fc6ccat","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味苦；甘；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-pec9nrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-pec9nrj","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-fnh7pn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-fnh7pn1","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】活血止痛；化瘀止血；消积解毒。主心腹血气诸痛；妇女闭经；产后瘀滞腹痛；崩漏下血；小儿疳积；蛇蝎蜈蚣咬伤"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-7rymi8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-7rymi8t","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，510g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-6waul5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-6waul5j","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-21o2b6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-21o2b6h","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】1.紫金丸(《产乳集验方》)，用治产后恶露不尽，腰痛，少腹如刺，时作寒热，头痛不思饮食。2.治经血不止方(《经效方》)，用治妇人经血不止。3.4.灵脂散(《永类钤方》)，用治丈夫脾积气痛，妇人血崩诸痛。5.治卒暴心痛方(《鸡峰普济方》)，用治卒暴心痛，不可忍者。6.治冷麻方(《本草衍义》)，用治冷气血闭，手足身体疼痛，冷麻。7.治肠风下血方(《永类钤方》)，用治肠风下血。8.治吐血方(《本草纲目》)。9.治虫心痛方(《阎氏小儿方论》)，用治虫心痛欲绝。10.治骨折肿痛方(《乾坤生意秘韫》)。11.接骨丹(《儒门事亲》)，用治损伤、接骨。12.治疮癞方(《摘元方》)。13.治毒虫伤方(《金匮钩玄》)，治蜈蚣蛇蝎毒虫伤。14.皱肺丸(《圣济总录》)，用治肺胀。15.退翳方(《明目经验方》)，用治目生浮翳。16.治重舌方(《经验良方》)，用治重舌，喉痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-y1zjhuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-y1zjhuu","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-l5vm1lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-l5vm1lv","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《开宝本草》：主疗心腹冷气，小儿五疳，辟疫、治肠风，通利气脉，女子月闭。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-fnrl03c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-fnrl03c","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草图经》：治伤冷积聚及小儿女子方中多用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-uwvjcyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-uwvjcyr","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草衍义补遗》：能行血止血。治心腹冷气，妇人心痛，血气刺痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-mku8x3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-mku8x3c","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草蒙筌》：行血宜生，止血须炒，通经闭及治经行不止；定产妇血晕，除小儿疳蛔。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-h3v9v30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-h3v9v30","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《纲目》：止妇人经水过多，赤带不绝，胎前产后，血气诸痛；男女一切心腹、胁肋、少腹诸痛，疝痛，血痢、肠风腹痛；身体血痹刺痛，肝疟发寒热，反胃，消渴及痰涎挟血成窠，血贯瞳子，血凝齿痛，重舌，小儿惊风，五癎，癫疾；杀虫，解药毒及蛇蝎蜈蚣伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-xot9jzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-xot9jzu","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草述》：主损伤接骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-fmrkspr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-fmrkspr","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《现代实用中药》：涂敷疮疥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-hh8ui46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-hh8ui46","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草衍义》：五灵脂行经血有功，不能生血。尝有人病眼中翳，往来不定，如此乃是血所病也。盖心生血，肝藏血，肝受血则能视，目病不治血为背理。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-bvg58cm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-bvg58cm","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《纲目》：五灵脂，足厥阴肝经药也，气味俱厚，阴中之阴，故入血分。肝主血，故此药能治血病，散血和血而止诸痛。止惊癎，除疟痢，消积化痰，疗疳杀虫，治血痹、血眼诸症，皆属肝经也。失笑散不独治妇人心痛血痛，凡男女老幼一切心腹胁肋少腹痛疝气，并胎前产后血气作痛及血崩经溢，俱能奏功。又按李仲南云，五灵脂治崩中，非止治血之药，乃去风之剂。冲任经虚，被风伤袭营血，以致崩中暴下，与荆芥、防风治崩义同。方悟古人识见深奥如此，此亦一说，恒未及肝血虚滞，亦自生风之意。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-z7gyyfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-z7gyyfa","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草经疏》：五灵脂，其功长于破血行血，故凡瘀血停滞作痛，产后血晕，恶血冲心，少腹儿枕痛，留血经闭，瘀血心胃间作痛，血滞经脉，气不得行，攻刺疼痛等证，在所必用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-ka2enda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-ka2enda","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《药品化义》：五灵脂，苦寒泄火，生用行血而不推荡，非若大黄之力迅而不守。以此通利血脉，使浊阴有归下之功，治头风、噎膈、痰癎、癫疾，诸毒热痈，女人经闭，小腹刺痛，产后恶露，大有功效。炒用以理诸失血证，令血自归经而不妄行，能治崩中胎漏及肠红血痢，奏绩独胜。"}]},{"ID":"20240830115039-7hin9xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115039-7hin9xh","updated":"20240830115116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830115040-p3lnlcr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830115040-p3lnlcr","updated":"20240830115116"}},{"ID":"20240830115041-r3u5qlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830115041-r3u5qlj","updated":"20240830115116"}}]}